# L §2.4 Version items (tally 2.1.7 R9, issue #148; #96): a same side keyed by a place keyed by things,
# lim[konto[ana]], sorts as the row of that target and key does, the two tied and ordered by their canonical lines
# (GD-28). 2.1.6's refcore put the row after both same items. (T's M0 format vector same_place_key_beside_row.)
=== options reprint
=== same_place_key_beside_row.tally
model same_place_key_beside_row
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind persons

place konto[p in persons]: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

input lim[k in accounts]: money PLN

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  persons + [ana] lives 2026-01-01..
  persons + [ben] lives 2026-01-01..
  same lim[konto[ben]] = lim[konto[ana]]
  same lim[konto[ana]] = lim[konto[ben]]
  lim[konto[ana]] = 5.00 PLN
=== expect
